dsh-skill-forge README · In your DSH profile directory (e.g. ~/.dsh/profiles/web)：pnpm add dsh-skill-forge@github:Epiphany-Leon/dsh-skill-forge
```

Then edit your profile's `package.json` to enable the bundle:

```json
{
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-base",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app",
        "dsh-skill-forge"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Restart DSH — the Skill Forge panel appears in the right sidebar.
